{"id": "st-james-infirmary-books-stop-adding-up", "title": "St. James Infirmary: $19M paid, never audited, $5.8M leaves its tax return unexplained", "seconds": 145.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "3640c407a07a844f", "words": 453, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "St. James Infirmary ran a small clinic for sex workers in the Tenderloin.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.77, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "Tenderloin", "hoodLabel": "Tenderloin", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.8, "kicker": "St. James Infirmary"}, "wt": [0.17, 0.38, 0.65, 1.18, 1.4, 1.51, 1.78, 2.1, 2.27, 2.5, 2.76, 2.82, 2.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "From 2019 to 2024, how much did the City pay it?", "t0": 3.89, "t1": 7.26, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Fiscal 2019 to 2024", "sub": "six City departments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.37, 0.74, 0.9, 1.1, 1.97, 2.11, 2.3, 2.42, 2.51, 2.72, 2.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "19.4 million dollars.", "t0": 7.26, "t1": 9.45, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$19.4 million", "label": "from six City departments", "sub": "and nothing since"}, "emph": ["19.4"], "wt": [0.04, 0.7, 1.07, 1.28, 1.68]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 9.97, "t1": 11.48, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.25, 0.35, 0.79, 0.92, 1.0]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "story[0]"], "text": "City payments rose from 1 million dollars in 2019 to 6.6 million in 2023.", "t0": 11.7, "t1": 17.5, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "City funding grows", "sub": "$1.0 million in fiscal 2019, $6.6 million in fiscal 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.65, 0.89, 1.05, 1.24, 1.57, 1.91, 2.03, 2.24, 2.82, 3.32, 3.51, 3.82, 4.12, 4.56, 4.76, 4.97]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The clinic's numbers come from its own reports to the State.", "t0": 17.62, "t1": 19.94, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "State clinic reports", "sub": "non-respondent in 2022 and 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.4, 0.72, 0.85, 0.99, 1.14, 1.34, 1.73, 1.84, 1.93]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "For 2022 and 2023, it filed none.", "t0": 20.06, "t1": 23.18, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "State clinic reports", "sub": "non-respondent in 2022 and 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.34, 0.82, 1.0, 1.21, 2.08, 2.22, 2.57]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[4]", "story[3]"], "text": "And in December 2023, the group said it would close.", "t0": 23.3, "t1": 26.17, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "The Controller", "sub": "fiscal 2023 findings left unresolved"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.18, 0.57, 0.84, 1.68, 1.77, 1.97, 2.16, 2.23, 2.46]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[12]", "next[6]"], "text": "The State filed its certificate of dissolution on 2 September 2026.", "t0": 26.29, "t1": 30.26, "shot": "b7d", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "x23s", "kicker": "Secretary of State · 2 September 2026", "text": "Certificate of dissolution: “has been completely wound up and is dissolved”", "mark": "dissolved"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.39, 0.59, 0.72, 1.13, 1.27, 1.85, 2.09, 2.34, 2.88, 3.25]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[4]"], "text": "The first lead: its last full tax return shows a small profit, 68,843 dollars.", "t0": 30.48, "t1": 36.52, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "The last full tax return", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "year to June 2024"}, "emph": ["68,843"], "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.36, 0.76, 1.18, 1.48, 1.73, 2.02, 2.35, 2.66, 2.77, 2.97, 3.63, 4.02, 4.42, 4.68, 4.95, 5.43]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "So its net worth should go up.", "t0": 36.64, "t1": 38.1, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["net assets, June 2023", "$5,923,529"], "b": ["net assets on the return, June 2024", "$204,560"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.27, 0.51, 0.76, 1.0, 1.2]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Instead it fell, to 204,560 dollars.", "t0": 38.22, "t1": 42.36, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["net assets, June 2023", "$5,923,529"], "b": ["net assets on the return, June 2024", "$204,560"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.53, 1.16, 1.38, 1.57, 1.85, 2.13, 2.64, 2.83, 3.13, 3.52]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "How much does the return leave unexplained?", "t0": 42.48, "t1": 44.34, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["net assets, June 2023", "$5,923,529"], "b": ["net assets on the return, June 2024", "$204,560"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.28, 0.4, 0.5, 0.82, 1.03]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "amount"], "text": "5.8 million dollars.", "t0": 44.34, "t1": 46.25, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,787,812", "label": "gone from the tax return with no line explaining it", "sub": "no write-off, no refund, no transfer"}, "emph": ["5.8"], "wt": [0.04, 0.58, 0.86, 0.97, 1.37]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "suspicious[0].what"], "text": "A year earlier, it booked 6.5 million dollars as income it was owed but hadn't received.", "t0": 46.77, "t1": 51.47, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Pledges and grants receivable", "chip": "$6,501,889"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.27, 0.78, 0.86, 1.14, 1.35, 1.65, 1.81, 2.21, 2.62, 2.82, 3.18, 3.26, 3.42, 3.76, 4.0, 4.42]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "By June 2024, that receivable was just gone. Money never collected must be written off.", "t0": 51.59, "t1": 57.36, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "nobody can tell from it whether the money was ever real"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.38, 0.59, 1.44, 1.6, 2.18, 2.35, 2.71, 3.43, 3.86, 4.13, 4.62, 4.91, 4.99, 5.37]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]", "story[5]"], "text": "But the books it filed to dissolve call 5,749,549 dollars", "t0": 57.48, "t1": 60.94, "shot": "b12a", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rct", "kicker": "Books filed with the charity registry for the dissolution", "text": "account 80200, Payments to Affiliates: $5,749,549.36", "mark": "Payments to Affiliates"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.2, 0.41, 0.54, 0.78, 0.88, 1.36, 1.67, 1.94, 2.15, 2.46, 2.67, 3.01]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]", "story[5]"], "text": "“Payments to Affiliates”. They name no affiliate.", "t0": 60.94, "t1": 64.24, "shot": "b12ax", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rct", "kicker": "Books filed with the charity registry for the dissolution", "text": "account 80200, Payments to Affiliates: $5,749,549.36", "mark": "Payments to Affiliates"}, "emph": ["Payments to Affiliates"], "wt": [0.04, 0.55, 0.69, 1.73, 1.92, 2.35, 2.62]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[3]"], "text": "The second lead: no outside check.", "t0": 64.46, "t1": 66.47, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Audited?", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "“No” in 2021, 2022, 2023 and 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.38, 0.78, 1.19, 1.6]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[3]"], "text": "Four tax returns in a row say no accountant audited or even reviewed the books.", "t0": 66.59, "t1": 70.59, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Audited?", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "“No” in 2021, 2022, 2023 and 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.58, 0.95, 1.03, 1.13, 1.38, 1.59, 1.76, 2.19, 2.66, 2.85, 3.1, 3.48, 3.58]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "The City expects audited books from groups this size.", "t0": 70.71, "t1": 73.47, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the City had only the organization’s own numbers"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.4, 0.87, 1.33, 1.63, 1.78, 2.05, 2.29]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[1]"], "text": "The third lead: in 2018, the clinic reported 1,224 visits.", "t0": 73.69, "t1": 78.66, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "The clinic", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "visits it reported to the State"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.36, 1.01, 1.14, 1.42, 2.0, 2.14, 2.41, 2.8, 2.95, 3.35, 3.54, 3.83, 4.3]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[1]"], "text": "By 2021, how many?", "t0": 78.78, "t1": 80.53, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "The clinic", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "visits it reported to the State"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.27, 1.0, 1.15]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "352.", "t0": 80.53, "t1": 82.04, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "352", "label": "clinic visits in 2021", "sub": "down 71% from 1,224"}, "emph": ["352"], "wt": [0.04, 0.39, 0.73]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Visits fell 71 percent,", "t0": 82.56, "t1": 84.33, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["local-government money, 2018", "$265,150"], "b": ["local-government money, 2021", "$1,771,668"]}, "emph": ["71 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.64, 1.11]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "while local government money rose more than sixfold.", "t0": 84.33, "t1": 86.89, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["local-government money, 2018", "$265,150"], "b": ["local-government money, 2021", "$1,771,668"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.45, 0.85, 1.1, 1.46, 1.64, 1.83]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The 2018 and 2021 reports are for two different clinic addresses.", "t0": 87.01, "t1": 90.53, "shot": "b18a", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2018 report", "234 Eddy Street"], "b": ["2021 report", "730 Polk Street"], "kicker": "Two clinic addresses"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.3, 0.63, 0.77, 1.02, 1.44, 1.78, 1.98, 2.18, 2.36, 2.71, 3.04]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[1]", "story[0]"], "text": "The fourth lead: a shelter on Bryant Street, given with no bidding.", "t0": 90.75, "t1": 94.21, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Bryant Street navigation center", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "Agreement 1000024043 · Dec 2021 to June 2024, no bid"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.33, 1.0, 1.11, 1.44, 1.58, 1.91, 2.26, 2.56, 2.71, 2.85]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[1]"], "text": "A clinic seeing a few hundred patients a year won a 9 million dollar shelter grant.", "t0": 94.33, "t1": 98.19, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Bryant Street navigation center", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "Agreement 1000024043 · Dec 2021 to June 2024, no bid"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.36, 0.62, 0.69, 0.82, 1.1, 1.49, 1.57, 1.85, 2.09, 2.17, 2.43, 2.76, 3.03, 3.37]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "On the federal count night in January 2023, how many of its 84 beds were full?", "t0": 98.31, "t1": 103.55, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Agreed, then paid", "sub": "$8,964,393 agreed", "chip": "$6,371,409 paid"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.15, 0.43, 0.69, 1.01, 1.25, 1.74, 1.95, 3.02, 3.16, 3.34, 3.43, 3.62, 4.18, 4.48, 4.65]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "33.", "t0": 103.55, "t1": 104.68, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "33", "label": "people in 84 beds", "sub": "39% of beds, on one night"}, "emph": ["33"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "The fifth lead: money going both ways.", "t0": 105.3, "t1": 107.56, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "St. James Infirmary", "sub": "granted $372,453"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "TGI Justice Project", "sub": "paid St. James $206,208"}], "kicker": "The fifth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.33, 0.71, 1.26, 1.55, 1.88]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "St. James gave TGI Justice Project 372,453 dollars.", "t0": 107.68, "t1": 112.88, "shot": "b24x", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "St. James Infirmary", "sub": "granted $372,453"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "TGI Justice Project", "sub": "paid St. James $206,208"}], "kicker": "The fifth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.55, 0.79, 1.24, 1.65, 2.12, 2.48, 2.7, 3.17, 3.59, 3.88, 4.11, 4.64]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "TGI paid St. James 206,208 for payroll.", "t0": 113.0, "t1": 117.04, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "St. James Infirmary", "sub": "granted $372,453"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "TGI Justice Project", "sub": "paid St. James $206,208"}], "kicker": "The fifth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.75, 0.96, 1.27, 1.4, 1.7, 1.94, 2.32, 2.6, 2.82, 3.1, 3.36]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why"], "text": "Both get City grants.", "t0": 117.16, "t1": 118.34, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the same public dollar can be counted as program spending twice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.49, 0.75]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why"], "text": "So when they pay each other, one public dollar can count as spending twice.", "t0": 118.46, "t1": 122.08, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the same public dollar can be counted as program spending twice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.21, 0.35, 0.49, 0.68, 1.23, 1.43, 1.76, 2.1, 2.28, 2.47, 2.57, 3.06]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "The Transgender District separately disclosed 35,000 dollars paid to a former president’s company.", "t0": 122.2, "t1": 127.08, "shot": "td24record", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "td24", "kicker": "2024 renewal", "text": "The Transgender District Company · $35,000 in training and services", "mark": "$35,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.6, 1.0, 1.49, 2.05, 2.53, 2.87, 3.21, 3.45, 3.56, 3.66, 3.93, 4.48]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "Its renewal does not trace those fees to St. James.", "t0": 127.2, "t1": 129.6, "shot": "td24source", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Source of the fees", "sub": "The renewal does not identify St. James money"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.49, 0.63, 0.79, 1.1, 1.33, 1.62, 1.73, 1.93]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Not shown: that any money was taken. The missing 5.8 million may never have been cash.", "t0": 129.82, "t1": 135.66, "shot": "b26", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any money was taken or misused", "Whether the City got unspent money back"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.77, 0.95, 1.15, 1.4, 1.57, 2.2, 2.94, 3.29, 3.55, 3.79, 3.95, 4.39, 4.68, 4.93, 5.06, 5.28]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[2]"], "text": "What would settle it? The papers behind that 6.5 million and its removal.", "t0": 135.78, "t1": 140.08, "shot": "b27", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Each department’s close-out records"}, {"who": "", "what": "The workpapers behind the vanished receivable"}], "focus": 1}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.27, 0.48, 1.14, 1.29, 1.68, 1.94, 2.17, 2.41, 2.66, 2.82, 3.25, 3.54, 3.69]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "No authority has reported a finding about its money.", "t0": 140.2, "t1": 142.52, "shot": "b28", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.63, 0.77, 1.23, 1.35, 1.56, 1.76, 1.91]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 142.64, "t1": 144.86, "shot": "b29", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.3, 0.41, 0.53, 1.24, 1.39, 1.53]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "On the record", "lead1": "Lead 1 · $5.8 million, gone", "lead2": "Lead 2 · never audited", "lead3": "Lead 3 · visits down 71%", "lead4": "Lead 4 · a no-bid shelter", "lead5": "Lead 5 · money both ways", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "number"}